# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Generated puzzle inventory — never enters Git, transferred to the VPS separately
forge/inventory/
# ⚠️ The reference batch's PRIVATE inventory, as of 2026-08-23. It holds all six signed packages and
# their dated pointers; `publish.rotate` publishes two of them into serve/data/puzzles, and those two
# ARE committed. Six in the deployed tree was the access model inverted -- two is what it allows.
forge/reference-inventory/

# Processed Retrosheet database and raw source files — rebuildable from the loader
forge/data/

